# hsm-sim 0.1.0: contention
# Two drives serve three kinds of work. Recalls go first (a reader is
# waiting), then migration, then repack. Repack needs both drives at the
# same moment, so the queued repack of T01 waits for a gap in the reads;
# once it starts it is not preempted, and the reads that arrive meanwhile
# wait for it (old-20.dat waits 310 s where a recall from a mounted tape
# takes 32 s). New writes are migrated in the gaps between recalls.
# cache 5000 MB, watermarks 10% high / 2% low
# 2 drive(s), 6 tape(s) x 1000 MB, mount 120 s, seek 30 s, 50 MB/s
# scan every 600 s, migrate after 0 s, auto-repack below 50% live

